### Example: Fake Login Page (Educational Purposes Only)
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Fake Login Page</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f4f4;
